jealousy, et cetera, et cetera.

00:43:41.310 --> 00:43:44.380
- Okay, what happens
after you get rid of it?

00:43:44.380 --> 00:43:47.131
- Oh, I didn't think about that [laughs].

00:43:47.131 --> 00:43:50.040
