00:43:50.040 --> 00:43:52.570
- Then you're standing out
in the middle of the desert.

00:43:52.570 --> 00:43:54.170
- You say you want to get off the bus?

00:43:54.170 --> 00:43:57.823
- Yeah, but I didn't, I wasn't
thinking what would be left over.

00:43:58.930 --> 00:44:00.520
All right, you got to think about it.

00:44:00.520 --> 00:44:02.493
